{items}

The Bible has 66 books and devotional channels especially benefit from variety — your audience returns for fresh teaching, not for the same six 'comfort verses' on rotation. Branch into less-quoted but theologically rich passages: 2 Corinthians 4:7-10 (treasure in jars of clay), Romans 12:1-2 (renewing of the mind), James 1:19-20 (slow to speak, slow to anger), 1 Peter 3:8-9 (live in harmony), Philippians 2:5-11 (the kenosis hymn), Hebrews 12:1-2 (cloud of witnesses), Ecclesiastes 3:1-8 (time for everything), Micah 6:8 (do justly, love mercy), Galatians 5:22-23 (fruit of the Spirit).
